      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "独自"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start a moment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the time you need.\nYou can finish whenever you like.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按照自己的节奏来。\n准备好后，随时可以结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app couldn't open its local journal. Your existing entries have not been intentionally deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用无法打开本地日记。现有记录没有被主动删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app requests exclusion from device backups. Use the JSON backup controls below to move records to another device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用会请求将数据排除在设备备份之外。如需迁移记录，请使用下方 JSON 备份功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The backup contains duplicate record identifiers. No records were changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份中有重复的记录标识符，未更改任何记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The backup contains more records than this app supports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份中的记录数量超出应用支持的上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The backup file is larger than the supported 25 MB limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份文件超过 25 MB 的大小限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The JSON file contains your journal entries and notes. Anyone who can open the file may be able to read them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 JSON 文件包含你的日记和备注。能够打开文件的人可能会看到其中内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The moment has an invalid date.": {
