    },
    "Discard this session?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要放弃本次记录吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PRIVACY": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐私"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Understand what stays on this device, how authentication works, and what a backup contains.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "了解哪些内容保存在本机、设备验证如何工作，以及备份包含哪些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Privacy information": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐私信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explains how the app stores your records, authentication, and backups.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说明本应用如何保存记录、处理设备验证和备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored locally": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅保存在本机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your entries stay on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的记录保存在此设备上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records you create are kept in this app's local storage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你创建的记录保存在本应用的本地存储中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is stored": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存了哪些内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your journal can include dates, durations, moment type, mood, rating, tags, an optional private note, and an optional place label from an imported backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日记可包含日期、时长、记录类型、心情、评分、标签、可选的私密笔记，以及导入备份中可能包含的地点标签。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No account or tracking": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无账户与追踪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version does not use an account, advertising, analytics, a health service, partner sharing, or app-run cloud sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本不使用账户、广告、分析统计、健康服务、伴侣共享或应用自建云同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device authentication": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you turn on App Lock, iOS checks Face ID, Touch ID, or your device passcode. The app receives the result, not biometric data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启应用锁后，iOS 会验证 Face ID、Touch ID 或设备密码。应用只接收验证结果，不会读取生物识别数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Backups": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A JSON backup includes saved entries and private notes. This app does not encrypt the file. You choose where to save it; a file provider may store it outside this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JSON 备份包含已保存的记录和私密笔记。本应用不会加密该文件。保存位置由你选择；文件服务提供方可能会将其存储在本机之外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deleting your entries": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete an entry in its detail screen, or choose Delete all local moments in Settings. These actions do not erase exported copies.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可在记录详情页删除单条记录，也可在设置中选择“删除本机的所有记录”。这些操作不会删除已导出的副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long entries stay": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录会保留多久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Entries remain in the app until you delete them. Copies at export destinations are handled separately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录会一直保留在应用中，直到你将其删除。导出到其他位置的副本需要单独管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Storage protection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储保护"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app requests iOS file protection and exclusion from device backups. Backup exclusion is best effort and is not guaranteed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用会请求 iOS 保护本地文件并将数据排除在设备备份之外，但排除请求无法保证始终生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard this reflection?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要放弃这次回顾吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard reflection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放弃回顾"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep editing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your unsaved reflection will be lost. Saved journal entries will not change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未保存的回顾内容将会丢失。已保存的日记记录不会改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
    ,
    "Replace your entire journal?": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "要替换整本日记吗？"}}}},
    "Replace journal": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "替换日记"}}}},
    "This deletes %lld local records and restores %lld records from the backup. Exported backup files will not change.": {"localizations": {"zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "这将删除本机的 %lld 条记录，并从备份恢复 %lld 条记录。已导出的备份文件不会改变。"}}}}
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
